      "text": "$t1 == '183'?\r\n`",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:42864:42880"
    },
    {
      "id": "183:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:42880:42882"
    },
    {
      "id": "183:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你吃完三明治，把空盘子放进水槽。再没有敲门声了。你大概是对的，这可能只是风把什么东西吹到了门上。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:42882:42932"
    },
    {
      "id": "183:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "夜色越来越深，气温越来越冷。你用手电筒照着走到床边，钻进被子里。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:42932:42966"
    },
    {
      "id": "183:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "在床脚对面的电视柜上，电视亮了起来。供电恢复了！\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:42966:42992"
    },
    {
      "id": "183:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要去开灯，转到 184。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:42992:43006"
    },
    {
      "id": "183:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要把那台倒霉的电视关掉，转到 185。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:43006:43027"
    }
  ]
}
